cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cellucid's community annotation layout in your work, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "Cellucid community annotation: a GitHub-backed layout for collaborative cell annotation"
# No `version:` field, by design. This repository publishes a contract, not a
# release: its identity is the three schema `$id` values it declares, which are
# compared as exact strings and are replaced by a new `-v2` identity rather
# than revised in place. The versioned companions are the Python
# (theislab/cellucid-python) and R (theislab/cellucid-r) packages, whose
# CITATION.cff files do carry `version:`.
authors:
  - family-names: Inecik
    given-names: Kemal
    email: k.inecik@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/theislab/cellucid-annotation"
url: "https://www.cellucid.com"
license: "BSD-3-Clause"
